# ── Package manager: pnpm only ──────────────────────────────────────
# packageManager in package.json pins pnpm; Vercel reads it from there.
# Stray lockfiles from npm/bun/yarn cause ERR_PNPM_LOCKFILE_MISSING_DEPENDENCY
# on Vercel and Vite cache invalidation locally. Never commit them.
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
bun.lockb
bun.lock
